OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy rain clears eastwards by
OL,6,Fmidday, followed by sunny spells with
OL,7,Fshowers. Mainly across western areas,
OL,8,Fwhere some may be heavy with isolated
OL,9,Fhail and thunder. Winds gradually ease
OL,10,Fbut remain gusty, especially in the
OL,11,Fwest. Temperatures above average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FScattered showers continue
OL,14,Fnear western coasts. Elsewhere remains
OL,15,Fdry with clear spells. Cooler than
OL,16,Frecent nights, especially across
OL,17,Feastern and southeastern areas, with
OL,18,Fisolated fog patches developing in
OL,19,Fsheltered areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
