OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FShowers across parts of
OL,6,FEngland and Wales gradually fade,
OL,7,Fleaving many areas drier and brighter.
OL,8,FCloud increases in Northern Ireland
OL,9,Fwith rain arriving later. Windy in
OL,10,Fwestern and northern areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
